{"id":"wb-7-1548","name":"万佛山石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"万佛山石窟","text":"万佛山石窟是位于中国河南省洛阳市孟津区西霞院街道柴河社区的一组佛教石窟，地处黄河北岸。石窟开凿于北魏时期，分为上、下两处寺院区域，保存有300余身造像，以三世佛造像和礼佛行列浮雕为主要题材。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%87%E4%BD%9B%E5%B1%B1%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F","revisionId":95427910,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95427910","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2169068f7a5f59dd0d55ac50.jpg","title":"20250716_Wanfoshan_Grottoes_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250716_Wanfoshan_Grottoes_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bf/20250716_Wanfoshan_Grottoes_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​万佛山石窟","width":320,"height":480}}